---
import Article from '../../../layouts/Article.astro';
---
<Article title="Recover your plan link" description="How to get your 8-week dead hang plan link back." h1="Lost your plan link?" crumbs={[{ name: 'Plan', href: '/plan/' }, { name: 'Lost link' }]} noindex>
<div class="article-body plan-page">
<ol>
<li>Check your browser bookmarks and history for the page that opened after you paid.</li>
<li>If you cannot find it, email <a href="mailto:hello@sunnypatel.co.uk">hello@sunnypatel.co.uk</a> with your Stripe receipt number and the email address you paid with.</li>
<li>I reissue the link by hand and reply to the address you paid with.</li>
</ol>
<p class="small-copy">Your payment is covered by a 14-day refund. Ask by email in the same way.</p>
</div>
</Article>
